@page "/"

<PageTitle>Utility Data Intelligence</PageTitle>

<div class="eyebrow">UTILITY DATA INTELLIGENCE PLATFORM</div>

<h1>Customer Data Onboarding</h1>

<p class="muted">
    Import, validate, review and onboard utility customer data
    through a centralized implementation workspace.
</p>

<div class="cards">
    <article>
        <div class="eyebrow">01 · IMPORT</div>
        <h2>Import Customer Data</h2>
        <p>
            Upload customer CSV files and start a structured
            onboarding process.
        </p>
        <a href="/imports">Go to Data Imports →</a>
    </article>

    <article>
        <div class="eyebrow">02 · VALIDATE</div>
        <h2>Validate Records</h2>
        <p>
            Identify missing fields, invalid emails, duplicate
            accounts and other data quality issues.
        </p>
        <a href="/imports">Review Import Results →</a>
    </article>

    <article>
        <div class="eyebrow">03 · ONBOARD</div>
        <h2>Manage Customer Accounts</h2>
        <p>
            Review approved customer records and access
            tenant-specific customer information.
        </p>
        <a href="/accounts">View Customer Accounts →</a>
    </article>
</div>

<article>
    <h2>Implementation Workflow</h2>

    <p>
        The platform provides a controlled onboarding process:
    </p>

    <ol>
        <li>Upload customer data.</li>
        <li>Process and validate imported records.</li>
        <li>Review validation errors and correct source data.</li>
        <li>Approve completed import batches.</li>
        <li>Commit valid records into customer accounts.</li>
    </ol>

    <a class="btn-primary" href="/dashboard">
        Open Implementation Dashboard
    </a>
</article>